{"file": "来自未来的女儿-第40集.mp4", "ep": 40, "duration": 60.3, "segments": [{"start": 5.01, "end": 6.49, "text": "管好你的眼珠子"}, {"start": 6.49, "end": 7.45, "text": "别瞎看"}, {"start": 8.38, "end": 9.42, "text": "孩子在呢"}, {"start": 9.42, "end": 10.5, "text": "说话注意点"}, {"start": 12.98, "end": 13.78, "text": "宝宝"}, {"start": 13.78, "end": 14.98, "text": "你叫什么名字啊"}, {"start": 15.22, "end": 16.62, "text": "宝宝云宝"}, {"start": 16.62, "end": 18.02, "text": "云姐您啦"}, {"start": 18.8, "end": 20.12, "text": "宝宝也姓云啊"}, {"start": 20.8, "end": 22.16, "text": "宝宝姓云"}, {"start": 22.48, "end": 24.32, "text": "又恰好坐上了云争的车"}, {"start": 24.64, "end": 26.08, "text": "车上还有儿童座椅"}, {"start": 26.32, "end": 28.08, "text": "我这是被人骗来当后妈了"}, {"start": 28.48, "end": 29.08, "text": "云争"}, {"start": 29.08, "end": 29.96, "text": "你给我停车"}, {"start": 33.25, "end": 34.09, "text": "大小姐"}, {"start": 34.29, "end": 35.09, "text": "车停了"}, {"start": 35.09, "end": 36.37, "text": "这是派出所吗"}, {"start": 36.37, "end": 37.29, "text": "所吗"}, {"start": 37.53, "end": 38.37, "text": "林静雀"}, {"start": 38.57, "end": 39.45, "text": "都开了三十分钟"}, {"start": 39.45, "end": 40.37, "text": "你才反映过来"}, {"start": 40.73, "end": 41.29, "text": "云齐"}, {"start": 41.29, "end": 42.17, "text": "把云宝抱出去"}, {"start": 42.17, "end": 43.09, "text": "我有事情跟他讲"}, {"start": 43.09, "end": 43.97, "text": "妈妈不走"}, {"start": 43.97, "end": 45.09, "text": "宝宝去给妈妈买早餐"}, {"start": 45.09, "end": 45.73, "text": "好不好"}, {"start": 56.14, "end": 56.94, "text": "你干吗"}, {"start": 57.52, "end": 58.48, "text": "两年不见"}, {"start": 58.88, "end": 60.2, "text": "以后耍流氓了对吧"}]}